/Title (A strategy that works in Lund may not work in Brussels. A municipal building that can become a shared cultural hub in one city may be legally unavailable in another. A vacant shop may be affordable in a small city but impossible to rent in a metropolitan centre. A heritage building may offer strong cultural identity, but require technical upgrades, accessibility investment, or long administrative negotiations.)
